{"seq":4,"slug":"performance-benchmarking","title":"性能优化与基准测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/systems-programming/performance-benchmarking","wordCount":806,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"性能优化与基准测试\">性能优化与基准测试</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>性能优化的前提是<strong>可测量的基线与可重复的对比</strong>：没有基准测试，任何&quot;优化&quot;都只是猜测。理解本篇的关键，是把优化划分为从算法到硬件的<strong>层级结构</strong>——层级越高收益越大，而真正的瓶颈位置只能由分析工具给出，不能凭直觉。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>先测量再优化</strong>：<code>criterion</code> 提供统计学上可靠的基准，<code>flamegraph</code>/<code>perf</code> 定位热点，<code>DHAT</code> 定位分配。</li>\n<li><strong>编译配置是零代码成本的收益</strong>：LTO、<code>codegen-units = 1</code>、<code>opt-level</code> 往往先于任何代码改写见效。</li>\n<li><strong>抽象不等于开销</strong>：迭代器链与手写循环在 release 下编译结果几乎一致，真正危险的是隐藏的堆分配与边界检查。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"rust-的性能优势\">Rust 的性能优势</h2><p>Rust 在系统编程领域具有与 C/C++ 比肩的性能，同时提供内存安全保证。零成本抽象、无垃圾回收、精确的内存控制是其性能基础。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性能因素</th>\n<th>Rust 的做法</th>\n<th>收益</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内存管理</td>\n<td>编译期所有权系统</td>\n<td>无 GC 停顿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抽象</td>\n<td>泛型单态化</td>\n<td>零运行时开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迭代器</td>\n<td>编译器融合优化</td>\n<td>等同手写循环</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内联</td>\n<td><code>#[inline]</code> + LTO</td>\n<td>减少函数调用开销</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"criterion-基准测试\">Criterion 基准测试</h2><p><code>criterion</code> 是 Rust 的标准基准测试框架，提供统计学上可靠的性能测量。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# Cargo.toml&#10;[dev-dependencies]&#10;criterion = { version = &quot;0.5&quot;, features = [&quot;html_reports&quot;] }&#10;&#10;[[bench]]&#10;name = &quot;my_benchmark&quot;&#10;harness = false\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Cargo.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[dev-dependencies]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>criterion = { version = \"0.5\", features = [\"html_reports\"] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[[bench]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>name = \"my_benchmark\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>harness = false</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// benches/my_benchmark.rs&#10;use criterion::{black_box, criterion_group, criterion_main, Criterion};&#10;&#10;fn fibonacci(n: u64) -&gt; u64 {&#10;    match n {&#10;        0 =&gt; 0,&#10;        1 =&gt; 1,&#10;        _ =&gt; fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2),&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn criterion_benchmark(c: &amp;mut Criterion) {&#10;    c.bench_function(&quot;fib 20&quot;, |b| b.iter(|| fibonacci(black_box(20))));&#10;&#10;    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(&quot;fibonacci&quot;);&#10;    for i in [10, 15, 20].iter() {&#10;        group.bench_with_input(&#10;            criterion::BenchmarkId::new(&quot;recursive&quot;, i),&#10;            i,&#10;            |b, &amp;i| b.iter(|| fibonacci(black_box(i))),&#10;        );&#10;    }&#10;    group.finish();&#10;}&#10;&#10;criterion_group!(benches, criterion_benchmark);&#10;criterion_main!(benches);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// benches/my_benchmark.rs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use criterion::{black_box, criterion_group, criterion_main, Criterion};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn fibonacci(n: u64) -> u64 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match n {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        0 => 0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        1 => 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _ => fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn criterion_benchmark(c: &#x26;mut Criterion) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c.bench_function(\"fib 20\", |b| b.iter(|| fibonacci(black_box(20))));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"fibonacci\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in [10, 15, 20].iter() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        group.bench_with_input(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            criterion::BenchmarkId::new(\"recursive\", i),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            i,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            |b, &#x26;i| b.iter(|| fibonacci(black_box(i))),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    group.finish();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>criterion_group!(benches, criterion_benchmark);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>criterion_main!(benches);</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"cargo bench\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bench</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"编译优化选项\">编译优化选项</h2><h3 id=\"编译配置\">编译配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# Cargo.toml&#10;[profile.release]&#10;opt-level = 3&#10;lto = true&#10;codegen-units = 1&#10;panic = &quot;abort&quot;&#10;strip = true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Cargo.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[profile.release]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>opt-level = 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lto = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>codegen-units = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>panic = \"abort\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>strip = true</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>opt-level = 3</code></td>\n<td>最高优化级别</td>\n<td>运行更快，编译更慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>lto = true</code></td>\n<td>链接时优化（Link-Time Optimization）</td>\n<td>跨 crate 内联，体积更小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>codegen-units = 1</code></td>\n<td>单代码生成单元</td>\n<td>更好的优化，编译更慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>panic = &quot;abort&quot;</code></td>\n<td>panic 时直接终止</td>\n<td>二进制更小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>strip = true</code></td>\n<td>剥离调试符号</td>\n<td>二进制更小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>target-cpu = &quot;native&quot;</code></td>\n<td>针对当前 CPU 优化</td>\n<td>使用特定指令集</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"性能分析工具\">性能分析工具</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;性能问题&quot;] --&gt; B{类型?}&#10;    B --&gt;|CPU 热点| C[&quot;flamegraph / perf&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|内存分配| D[&quot;DHAT / heaptrack&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|指令级| E[&quot;cargo-asm / Godbolt&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|缓存未命中| F[&quot;cachegrind / perf stat&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"性能问题\"] --&gt; B{类型?}\n    B --&gt;|CPU 热点| C[\"flamegraph / perf\"]\n    B --&gt;|内存分配| D[\"DHAT / heaptrack\"]\n    B --&gt;|指令级| E[\"cargo-asm / Godbolt\"]\n    B --&gt;|缓存未命中| F[\"cachegrind / perf stat\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>安装/使用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>flamegraph</code></td>\n<td>CPU 火焰图</td>\n<td><code>cargo install flamegraph</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>perf</code></td>\n<td>Linux 性能计数器</td>\n<td>系统自带</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cargo-asm</code></td>\n<td>查看生成的汇编</td>\n<td><code>cargo install cargo-show-asm</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Godbolt</code></td>\n<td>在线编译器资源管理器</td>\n<td>godbolt.org</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>valgrind --tool=callgrind</code></td>\n<td>调用图分析</td>\n<td>系统安装</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DHAT</code></td>\n<td>堆分配分析</td>\n<td><code>cargo install dhat</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"常见优化技巧\">常见优化技巧</h2><h3 id=\"避免不必要的堆分配\">避免不必要的堆分配</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn optimized(data: &amp;[String]) -&gt; Vec&lt;&amp;str&gt; {&#10;    data.iter().map(|s| s.as_str()).collect()&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn with_smallvec() {&#10;    use smallvec::SmallVec;&#10;    let mut buf: SmallVec&lt;[u8; 64]&gt; = SmallVec::new();&#10;    buf.extend_from_slice(b&quot;hello&quot;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn optimized(data: &#x26;[String]) -> Vec&#x3C;&#x26;str> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data.iter().map(|s| s.as_str()).collect()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn with_smallvec() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    use smallvec::SmallVec;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut buf: SmallVec&#x3C;[u8; 64]> = SmallVec::new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    buf.extend_from_slice(b\"hello\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"使用迭代器而非索引\">使用迭代器而非索引</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn sum_indexed(data: &amp;[i32]) -&gt; i32 {&#10;    let mut sum = 0;&#10;    for i in 0..data.len() {&#10;        sum += data[i]; // 每次访问都有边界检查&#10;    }&#10;    sum&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn sum_iter(data: &amp;[i32]) -&gt; i32 {&#10;    data.iter().sum() // 无边界检查，可能 SIMD 优化&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn sum_indexed(data: &#x26;[i32]) -> i32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut sum = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in 0..data.len() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        sum += data[i]; // 每次访问都有边界检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sum</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn sum_iter(data: &#x26;[i32]) -> i32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data.iter().sum() // 无边界检查，可能 SIMD 优化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"预分配容量\">预分配容量</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn collect_items(n: usize) -&gt; Vec&lt;i32&gt; {&#10;    let mut result = Vec::with_capacity(n);&#10;    for i in 0..n as i32 {&#10;        result.push(i * 2);&#10;    }&#10;    result&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn collect_items(n: usize) -> Vec&#x3C;i32> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut result = Vec::with_capacity(n);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in 0..n as i32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        result.push(i * 2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"simd-优化\">SIMD 优化</h2><p>Rust 支持通过 <code>std::simd</code>（nightly）或 <code>packed_simd</code> / <code>wide</code> 使用 SIMD 指令。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[cfg(target_arch = &quot;x86_64&quot;)]&#10;use std::arch::x86_64::*;&#10;&#10;#[cfg(target_arch = &quot;x86_64&quot;)]&#10;unsafe fn sum_avx(data: &amp;[f32]) -&gt; f32 {&#10;    let mut acc = _mm256_setzero_ps();&#10;    let chunks = data.chunks_exact(8);&#10;    let remainder = chunks.remainder();&#10;&#10;    for chunk in chunks {&#10;        let v = _mm256_loadu_ps(chunk.as_ptr());&#10;        acc = _mm256_add_ps(acc, v);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    let mut result = [0.0f32; 8];&#10;    _mm256_storeu_ps(result.as_mut_ptr(), acc);&#10;    let sum: f32 = result.iter().sum();&#10;    sum + remainder.iter().sum::&lt;f32&gt;()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[cfg(target_arch = \"x86_64\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::arch::x86_64::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[cfg(target_arch = \"x86_64\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unsafe fn sum_avx(data: &#x26;[f32]) -> f32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut acc = _mm256_setzero_ps();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let chunks = data.chunks_exact(8);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let remainder = chunks.remainder();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for chunk in chunks {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let v = _mm256_loadu_ps(chunk.as_ptr());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        acc = _mm256_add_ps(acc, v);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut result = [0.0f32; 8];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _mm256_storeu_ps(result.as_mut_ptr(), acc);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let sum: f32 = result.iter().sum();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sum + remainder.iter().sum::&#x3C;f32>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"性能优化清单\">性能优化清单</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>优化项</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>算法</td>\n<td>选择合适的数据结构和算法</td>\n<td>代码审查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译</td>\n<td>LTO + codegen-units=1 + opt-level=3</td>\n<td>Cargo.toml</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分配</td>\n<td>减少堆分配，使用 <code>SmallVec</code>/栈缓冲</td>\n<td>DHAT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPU</td>\n<td>避免分支、利用 SIMD</td>\n<td>flamegraph</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存</td>\n<td>数据局部性，避免随机访问</td>\n<td>cachegrind</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I/O</td>\n<td>使用 BufReader/BufWriter 缓冲</td>\n<td>strace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发</td>\n<td>无锁数据结构、减少锁竞争</td>\n<td>perf</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>优化从建立基线开始：<code>criterion</code> 提供可靠基准，<code>flamegraph</code>/<code>perf</code>/<code>DHAT</code> 分别定位 CPU 热点、分配与缓存问题。</li>\n<li>编译层优化（<code>lto</code>、<code>codegen-units = 1</code>、<code>opt-level = 3</code>）改配置即可获得，通常应先尝试。</li>\n<li>常见收益点：减少堆分配（<code>SmallVec</code>、预分配容量）、用迭代器替代索引访问、提升数据局部性。</li>\n<li>迭代器与泛型是零成本抽象，release 下与手写循环性能相当；真正的开销来自隐藏的分配与跨边界拷贝。</li>\n<li>每一步优化都应重新测量以确认收益，避免把复杂度换成无实际改善的代码。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"性能优化与基准测试","id":"性能优化与基准测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Rust 的性能优势","id":"rust-的性能优势"},{"level":2,"text":"Criterion 基准测试","id":"criterion-基准测试"},{"level":2,"text":"编译优化选项","id":"编译优化选项"},{"level":3,"text":"编译配置","id":"编译配置"},{"level":2,"text":"性能分析工具","id":"性能分析工具"},{"level":2,"text":"常见优化技巧","id":"常见优化技巧"},{"level":3,"text":"避免不必要的堆分配","id":"避免不必要的堆分配"},{"level":3,"text":"使用迭代器而非索引","id":"使用迭代器而非索引"},{"level":3,"text":"预分配容量","id":"预分配容量"},{"level":2,"text":"SIMD 优化","id":"simd-优化"},{"level":2,"text":"性能优化清单","id":"性能优化清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"嵌入式与 no_std","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/systems-programming/embedded-and-nostd"},"next":{"title":"Cargo 与包管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/ecosystem/cargo"}}